# Traceability (AZDO work item ID)

Always include the Azure DevOps User Story / Bug ID:

1. **Branch:** `feature/1234-short-description` (or `bug/1234-…`)
2. **Commits:** `#1234 Add API endpoint` (numeric ID only — no AB# prefix)
3. **PR:** link the work item (via branch name or manual link)

Do not start implementation without a work item ID from the user or ticket context.
